OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds could be hit by
OL,4,Achemotherapy scandal, trust says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS trust is reviewing the care of
OL,7,Fhundreds of patients after brain cancer
OL,8,Fpatients were given years of
OL,9,Funnecessary chemotherapy, its chief
OL,10,Fexecutive has said.
OL,12,FProf Andy Hardy, chief executive of
OL,13,FUniversity Hospitals Coventry and
OL,14,FWarwickshire (UHCW) NHS Trust, said the
OL,15,Fnumber affected could be "in the
OL,16,Fhundreds" as the trust reviews everyone
OL,17,Ftreated by retired oncologist Prof Ian
OL,18,FBrown since 2005.
OL,20,FHe apologised to patients and families,
OL,21,Fadmitting the failings should have been
OL,22,Ffound and stopped earlier.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
